  "ruleText": "Env-A 2907.07 Notification. The AAR for an affected source shall comply with the notification requirements of 40 CFR §75.61, except that the notice shall also be submitted to the ATS administrator.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2910.07); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
